摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Hub","id":"gh:1348236543","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-hub","slug":"kirbylynx/dsh-hub","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Hub"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-hub"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Language: English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-hub` provides a multi-tenant remote access and control center for\nDSH (DeepSeek Harness) instan"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ces running\non multiple machines."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DSH intentionally listens only on loopback (`127.0.0.1:3080`) and rejects\n`--host 0.0.0.0`, so that "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"agent shell and file capabilities are not exposed to\nthe network. `dsh-hub` connects those loopback-"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"only instances to a public center\nthrough registration plus outbound tunnels. Users authenticate at "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"the center\nwith Authelia, select a namespace and instance in the Portal, and open the\noriginal DSH W"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"eb GUI through a full-page instance entry. iframe embedding remains\nlimited and experimental."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Star topology: every instance connects outbound to the center; no public\ninstance port and no P2P "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"path are required.\n- The center handles registration, relay, Portal, and authentication. It does\nnot"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" understand DSH business payloads; relay traffic is byte-forwarded.\n- The two instance-side delivery"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" modes, plugin and client, share the same relay\nprotocol. See docs/protocol.md."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Components"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Component | Description | Status |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| `dsh-hub-service` | Center service for registration, tunnel relay, Portal, and SQLite persistence."},{"id":"p10s2","text":" It can run directly with Node.js or through Docker Compose with Caddy + Authelia + LLDAP, including"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" an existing-Caddy backend profile. The v0.1.x baseline includes internal-only Prometheus `/metrics`"},{"id":"p10s4","text":", tunnel-level uncredited-byte accounting, high/low-water send gates, fair sender scheduling, local "},{"id":"p10s5","text":"backpressure checks, release runbooks, history-relay safeguards, `deploymentMode` metadata, LLDAP-ba"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"cked invite registration, namespace roles, admin user controls, namespace/user/admin-console managem"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ent, member management, invite management, registry-key reveal/update, instance ACLs, LLDAP-backed s"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"elf-service password changes, system-admin password resets, and audit APIs. | v0.1.7 release baselin"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"e; suitable for trusted self-hosted evaluation |\n| `dsh-hub-plugin` | Preferred instance-side delive"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"ry mode. It runs inside DSH and provides the host plugin skeleton, explicit `remote-capabilities.pat"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"ch.yml`, DSH browse picker overlay, hosted `/workspace`-restricted picker overlay, `dsh.client` brow"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"ser card, plugin tunnel adapter, registry/replacement join, instance credential storage, automatic t"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"unnel startup, token rotate/leave, host/browser status views, local DSH session/workspace diagnostic"},{"id":"p10s14","text":"s, same-origin live status bridge, remote-origin-gated history autoload, `host.describe.canOpenPath="},{"id":"p10s15","text":"false` UI gating, hosted model/provider settings for DeepSeek official and OpenAI-compatible/custom "},{"id":"p10s16","text":"Base URL providers, `dsh-hub-web` one-command startup, read-only install checks, default-dry-run pro"},{"id":"p10s17","text":"file installer, and plugin join CLI. | v0.1.7 recommended path |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick start: service + standalone client"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> Requirement: Node.js >= 22. This project is developed and verified on Node 24."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Plugin remote mode: install, join, and one-command startup"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`dsh-hub-web` is a safe wrapper around `dsh web`. It does not store registry\nkeys, replacement grant"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"s, or instance tokens. At startup it applies the plugin\nenabled patch plus `remote-capabilities.patc"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"h.yml`, so remote browse picker and\n`canOpenPath=false` UI gating are active. `plugin-install` is dr"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"y-run by default\nand writes a DSH profile only when `--apply` is provided."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The v0.1.7 release baseline keeps the v0.1.2 validated large-session history\nloading path, the v0.1."},{"id":"p17s2","text":"3 hosted model/provider settings panel, and the v0.1.4\nproduction release hygiene docs. It builds on"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" the v0.1.5 LLDAP-backed\nmulti-user baseline, the v0.1.6 G3 namespace/admin console, and adds G15\nLL"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"DAP-backed password management: users can change their own password after\nentering the current passw"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ord, while system administrators can reset another\nHub user's password with an audit reason. Passwor"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"d request fingerprints use a\nstable service-side password idempotency HMAC key, so token pepper rota"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"tion does\nnot break short-term idempotent replays. Users can create and edit their own namespaces, s"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"ystem administrators can create\nnamespaces for active users, authorized namespace managers can revea"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"l/copy or\nupdate the current registry key, and instance lifecycle/diagnostic actions are\naudited. Re"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"gistry keys and replacement grants should still be supplied through\nstdin or interactive input on th"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"replacement grants should still be supplied through\nstdin or interactive input on the instance side."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### First use: create a namespace and registry key"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Center authentication is the only security boundary.** After the center\nforwards a request, DSH se"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"es it like a request from a local browser. The instance\nside rewrites Host to `127.0.0.1` and strips"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" Origin / `sec-fetch-*` headers so\nDSH's local Host fence can be satisfied, including privileged met"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"in / `sec-fetch-*` headers so\nDSH's local Host fence can be satisfied, including privileged methods."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Any path that bypasses center authentication and directly reaches an instance\nmust be impossible. "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"Instances receive traffic only through outbound tunnels.\n- User -> namespace -> instance ACLs are en"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"forced by the center.\n- Authelia uses LLDAP as the identity backend in the deployment templates; the"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"\nHub stores authorization metadata and provisions invited users into LLDAP.\n- Authelia rules must co"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ver every instance subdomain (`*.hub.example.com`) so\nusers cannot bypass the Portal by opening an i"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"nstance host directly.\n- Instance tokens can be revoked; revocation closes tunnels. Registry keys ca"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"n\nbe rotated for future registration.\n- TLS is required end to end (`https` + `wss`), and instances "},{"id":"p22s8","text":"must verify the\ncenter certificate."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> One instance per subdomain is a hard requirement. DSH Web resolves APIs from\n> `location.origin + "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"\"/api/...\"` and cannot be mounted under a URL path prefix.\n> Each instance therefore lives at the ro"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ot of its own subdomain, such as\n> `<instanceId>.hub.example.com` or `<instanceId>.localhost` for lo"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"omain, such as\n> `<instanceId>.hub.example.com` or `<instanceId>.localhost` for local\n> development."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Milestones"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- **M1A/M1B**: security, credentials, protocol, and bounded relay are complete\nand reviewed.\n- **M1C"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"**: baseline real-DSH HTTP/WS and full-page instance access passed.\niframe, restart recovery, long c"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"hat/tool/attachment flows, and npm\n`latest/next` still need broader testing.\n- **M2**: deployment te"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"mplates for all-in-one Compose and existing-Caddy backend\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
